/-! ## §1 — THE PER-CHANNEL DEEPEST SCALE AND THE RESIDUE DENSITY. -/

/-- THE PER-CHANNEL DEEPEST SCALE. The banked seesaw/ν unit `m₀ = seesawScale M` (N333, the n=2
